# Git
.DS_Store

# Personal monthly status report (WWF internal reporting, not project documentation)
MONTHLY_REPORT.md

# Slack/email message drafts — personal communication scratch, never meant to be committed.
# Naming convention: {recipient}_{topic}_{YYYY-MM-DD}.draft.md, colocated with the topic's docs.
# Once actually sent, delete the file rather than leaving it around as a stale draft.
*.draft.md

